    "created_at": "2016-05-16T15:54:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-16T15:54:52Z",
    "body": "Well that isn't weird, but nothing in the spec guarantees it is actually happening that way, since the click or relevant user event leading to click dispatching have been queued already when the task to fire change/input is queued.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
